hadiths[6]{hadithnumber,text}:
"449","Mujhe Yahya ne Malik se, unhon ne Abdullah bin Abi Bakr bin Amr bin Hazm se riwayat kya ke unhon ne Abbad bin Tamim ko kehte suna ke maine Abdullah bin Zaid Mazni ko kehte suna ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) Eidgah ki taraf nikle aur barish mangi aur apni chadar ko palta jab qibla ki taraf munh kya."
"450","Mujhe Yahya ne Malik se, unhon ne Yahya bin Saeed se, unhon ne Amr bin Shuaib se riwayat kya ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) jab barish mangte to farmate ke aey Allah apne bandon aur apne janwaron ko sairab kar aur apni rehmat phela aur apne murda shehar ko zinda kar."
"451","Mujhe Malik se, unhon ne Shareek bin Abdullah bin Abi Namr se, unhon ne Anas bin Malik se riwayat kya ke unhon ne kaha ke aik shakhs Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke paas aaya aur kaha ke ya Rasulullah maweshi halaak ho gae aur raste kat gae to Allah se dua karein. To Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne dua ki aur hum par Juma se Juma tak barish hui. Unhon ne kaha ke phir aik shakhs Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke paas aaya aur kaha ke ya Rasulullah ghar gir gae aur raste kat gae aur maweshi halaak ho gae. To Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke aey Allah pahadon ki pushton aur teelon aur wadiyon ke peton aur darakhton ke ugne ki jaghon par. Unhon ne kaha ke Madina se badal kapde ki tarah chhat gae."
"452","Mujhe Yahya ne Malik se, unhon ne Salih bin Kaisan se, unhon ne Ubaidullah bin Abdullah bin Utba bin Masud se, unhon ne Zaid bin Khalid Juhani se riwayat kya ke unhon ne kaha ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne humein Hudaibiya mein Fajr ki Namaz padhai raat ki barish ke baad, phir jab Aap phire to logon ki taraf mutawajja hue aur farmaya ke kya tum jante ho tumhare Rab ne kya kaha. Unhon ne kaha ke Allah aur us ke Rasul behtar jante hain. Aap ne farmaya ke farmaya ke mere bandon mein se subah mujh par iman wala aur mujh se kufr karne wala hua, phir jo kehta hai ke hum par Allah ke fazl aur us ki rehmat se barish hui wo mujh par iman wala aur sitare se kufr karne wala hai, aur jo kehta hai ke hum par falan falan naushatra se barish hui wo mujh se kufr karne wala aur sitare par iman wala hai."
"453","Mujhe Malik se riwayat pahunchi ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) farmate they ke jab samandari badal chhae phir Sham ki taraf jhuke to ye bhari nazar wali aankh hai."
"454","Mujhe Malik se riwayat pahunchi ke Abu Huraira kehte they ke jab subah hoti aur logon par barish ho chuki hoti to kehte ke hum par Fatah ke naushatra se barish hui, phir ye aayat tilawat karte ke jo rehmat Allah logon ke liye khole use koi rokne wala nahi aur jo roke use us ke baad koi bhejne wala nahi."
